    {
      "type": "split",
      "html": "<h2>Uturn Logo DeSign</h2><p>UTurn's logo is inspired by the idea of returns being shipped directly to the next client, rather than to the warehouse. The letters of the logo are built from the letter U, and two dots are added to represent the capturing of returns. This design is used in animations to demonstrate how UTurn resells returned products to the next buyer.</p>",
